==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the Combat Breed [[Paldean form]] of {{p|Tauros}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Paldean Tauros|108}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Rear Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Rapidash|44}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

